ted. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a 129323009 (Scraping - action)</li><li>Include codes from<a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a 73416001 (Urine specimen collection, clean catch)</li><li>Include codes from<a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a 225113003 (Timed urine collection)</li><li>Include codes from<a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a 70777001 (Urine specimen collection, catheterized)</li><li>Include codes from<a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a 386089008 (Collection of coughed sputum)</li><li>Include codes from<a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a 278450005 (Finger stick)</li></ul></div>"
